WEBVTT

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:11.576
Choose Users in the side menu.

00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:17.826
Type "adaeze" in the Search
by email or profile name box.

00:00:19.907 --> 00:00:24.383
Click Search.

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:30.633
Click adaeze@example.test
to open the account.

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:36.024
Scroll to Signed in on.

00:00:36.274 --> 00:00:41.045
Click Sign out everywhere.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:47.295
Type "Phone was lost" in the Reason box.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:53.667
Click Sign out everywhere to confirm.

00:00:57.422 --> 00:01:01.744
Click Suspend account.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:07.994
Type "Shared the account"
in the Reason box.

00:01:08.831 --> 00:01:14.831
Click Suspend account to confirm.

00:01:18.336 --> 00:01:24.336
Click Reinstate account.

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:31.829
Click Reinstate account to confirm.
